{
  "id": "plant-watering",
  "name": "Plant watering",
  "summary": "A soil sensor checks how dry the soil is and a relay runs the pump for 3 seconds when it is too dry.",
  "difficulty": "medium",
  "minutes": 45,
  "needs": [
    "adc"
  ],
  "learn": [
    "Read an analog sensor in millivolts",
    "Calibrate a sensor with two known points (dry and wet)",
    "Switch a pump safely through a relay, with a pause between waterings"
  ],
  "parts": [
    {
      "id": "soil1",
      "partId": "soil-moisture-capacitive",
      "label": "Soil"
    },
    {
      "id": "relay1",
      "partId": "relay-1ch",
      "label": "Relay"
    }
  ],
  "pins": {
    "SOIL": {
      "part": "soil1",
      "pin": "AOUT"
    },
    "PUMP": {
      "part": "relay1",
      "pin": "IN"
    }
  },
  "notes": [
    "The pump is not wired to the board: it goes through the relay's COM and NO contacts, with its own supply.",
    "DRY_MV and WET_MV are example values: measure your sensor in dry air and in water and put your numbers in."
  ],
  "code": {
    "globals": [
      "const int SOIL_PIN = {SOIL};",
      "const int PUMP_PIN = {PUMP};",
      "const int RELAY_ON = HIGH;   // many relay modules switch on with LOW: set LOW if yours does",
      "const long DRY_MV = 2600;    // sensor in dry air (measure yours)",
      "const long WET_MV = 1200;    // sensor in a glass of water (measure yours)",
      "const int DRY_BELOW = 40;    // water when the soil is drier than this (%)",
      "unsigned long lastCheck = 0, pumpSince = 0, lastWatering = 0;",
      "bool pumping = false;"
    ],
    "setup": [
      "  Serial.begin(115200);",
      "  probe.begin(200);",
      "  pinMode(PUMP_PIN, OUTPUT);",
      "  digitalWrite(PUMP_PIN, !RELAY_ON);  // pump off at start",
      "  probe.state(\"WAITING\");"
    ],
    "loop": [
      "  if (pumping && millis() - pumpSince >= 3000) {",
      "    probe.step(\"Stop the pump\");",
      "    digitalWrite(PUMP_PIN, !RELAY_ON);",
      "    pumping = false;",
      "    lastWatering = millis();",
      "    probe.state(\"WAITING\");",
      "    probe.event(\"Pump off. Waiting 30 s for the water to soak in\");",
      "  }",
      "  if (millis() - lastCheck >= 1000) {",
      "    lastCheck = millis();",
      "    probe.step(\"Read the soil sensor\");",
      "    long mv = {READ_MV:SOIL};",
      "    int moisture = constrain(map(mv, DRY_MV, WET_MV, 0, 100), 0, 100);  // drier soil = higher voltage",
      "    probe.value(\"moisture\", moisture, SOIL_PIN);",
      "    bool rested = lastWatering == 0 || millis() - lastWatering >= 30000;",
      "    if (!pumping && moisture < DRY_BELOW && rested) {",
      "      probe.step(\"Too dry: start the pump\");",
      "      probe.state(\"WATERING\");",
      "      probe.event(\"Soil below 40%: pump on for 3 s\");",
      "      digitalWrite(PUMP_PIN, RELAY_ON);",
      "      pumping = true;",
      "      pumpSince = millis();",
      "    }",
      "  }",
      "  probe.loop();"
    ]
  },
  "sim": {
    "loopMs": 1000,
    "vars": {
      "pumping": 0,
      "rested": 1
    },
    "inputs": {
      "SOIL": {
        "level": {
          "start": 52,
          "perSecond": -1.2,
          "min": 5,
          "max": 95
        }
      }
    },
    "loop": [
      {
        "if": "pumping == 1",
        "then": [
          {
            "if": "pump_done",
            "then": [
              {
                "step": "Stop the pump"
              },
              {
                "write": "PUMP",
                "level": 0
              },
              {
                "set": "pumping",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "timer": "rest",
                "ms": 30000
              },
              {
                "set": "rested",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "bump": "SOIL",
                "by": 35
              },
              {
                "state": "WAITING"
              },
              {
                "event": "Pump off. Waiting 30 s for the water to soak in"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "if": "rest_done",
        "then": [
          {
            "set": "rested",
            "value": 1
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "step": "Read the soil sensor"
      },
      {
        "read": "SOIL",
        "as": "moisture",
        "unit": "%",
        "digits": 0
      },
      {
        "if": "moisture < 40",
        "then": [
          {
            "if": "pumping == 0",
            "then": [
              {
                "if": "rested",
                "then": [
                  {
                    "step": "Too dry: start the pump"
                  },
                  {
                    "state": "WATERING"
                  },
                  {
                    "event": "Soil below 40%: pump on for 3 s"
                  },
                  {
                    "write": "PUMP",
                    "level": 1
                  },
                  {
                    "set": "pumping",
                    "value": 1
                  },
                  {
                    "timer": "pump",
                    "ms": 3000
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "sources": [
    {
      "title": "DFRobot SEN0193 capacitive soil moisture sensor wiki",
      "section": "Calibration (dry air and water)"
    },
    {
      "title": "Songle SRD-05VDC-SL-C datasheet",
      "section": "Coil voltage 5 V; contact COM/NO/NC"
    }
  ]
}
